==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|πεπτός||digested}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|biochemistry}} A [[class]] of [[organic]] [[compound]]s consisting of various numbers of [[amino acid]]s in which the [[amine]] of one is reacted with the [[carboxylic acid]] of the next to form an [[amide]] bond.
# {{lb|en|biochemistry}} The [[peptide bond]] itself.

====Hyponyms====
* See also [[Wikisaurus:peptide]]

